  _title: The Wonderful Wizard of Oz
  _glyph: "\U0001F32A\uFE0F"
  _description: 'A demo for Lore: the world of L. Frank Baum''s novel "The Wonderful
    Wizard of Oz" (1900, public domain), set up as the lore of a small adventure
    game.


    Browse the Categories on the left, open the Insights below, and follow
    the links in the descriptions. Some Entries are **deliberately unfinished or
    broken**, so Health and Integrity have something to show.


    Start with [[bff2dcff-df4c-46a2-a793-2f30f4a6a243|Dorothy
    Gale]], or follow the story from its first Quest, [[cba6fa15-fd99-4b9d-8c48-62926d74c5c1|The
    Council with the Munchkins]].'
  _links:
  - _label: The book on Project Gutenberg
    _url: https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/55
  - _label: The book on Wikipedia
    _url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Wonderful_Wizard_of_Oz
